{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23832","headline":"闻乐感邻 · 白居易","name":"闻乐感邻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"老去亲朋零落尽，秋来弦管感伤多。\n尚书宅畔悲邻笛，廷尉门前叹雀罗。\n绿绮窗空分妓女，绦纱帐掩罢笙歌。\n欢娱未足身先去，争奈书生薄命何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23832.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23832","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}